      <Text>IDLE is the default system state. But if the system is in idle, the start pb is pushed and atleast one basket is present, all the bay dampers are closed and the supply and exhaust fan speeds match the config then we move on to pre purge cycle
</Text>
      <RtfText>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Microsoft Sans Serif;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green128\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\f0\fs17 IDLE is the default system state. But if the system is in idle, the start pb is pushed and atleast one basket is present, all the bay dampers are closed and the supply and exhaust fan speeds match the config then we move on to pre purge cycle\par
\par
}
</RtfText>
